&#8220;I don’t need to go get my a– reduced,” she said in an IG Live session. “News flash: I did get my a– reduced.&#8221; Cardi admitted she&#8217;s had surgeries in January 2024 and August 2022 to get the polymers in her butt removed.

&#8220;Unlike certain celebrities, I can’t just go and lipo my butt, because my skin is like kinda loose,” she continued. “That’s why my a– shakes so much. So if I just go and get a lipo reduction, that is the easy way, my a– could drop. So I would have to cut myself, and I’m not cutting myself. I’m not sitting down for four months. I’m outside, like I said.”

